{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e06-scene-19",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "更自由的音乐空间  (A Freer Space for Your Music)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At a quiet music bar, Chun Yuqiao listens to Xin Huimei sing a few bars purely for herself, dismisses the tabloid smears as nonsense, and invites her to join Xingtian. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "听天后唱现场，刚刚那两句价值不菲。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "只是自己喜欢唱歌，纯喜欢，不卖钱。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "其实个性和商业之间的界限很难区分。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "与其签在一个把你当成商品一样的公司。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你有没有想过选择一个更自由的地方？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "来建立围绕你自己的音乐空间。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "真没想到，有点突兀。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你不怕我的那些富豪大佬？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "就你门口站的那两位，富豪大佬很难进来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我这个人名声不好，不是自找麻烦吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那都是低智商的谣言。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你一点都不信啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "能有几个像你一样，在私人名下有慈善基金呢？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "听天后唱现场，刚刚那两句价值不菲。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hearing a pop diva sing live—those two lines just now were priceless.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "只是自己喜欢唱歌，纯喜欢，不卖钱。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I just enjoy singing for myself—pure affection, not for sale.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "其实个性和商业之间的界限很难区分。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In truth, the line between individuality and commerce is hard to draw.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "与其签在一个把你当成商品一样的公司。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Rather than signing with a company that treats you like a commodity—'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你有没有想过选择一个更自由的地方？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'have you ever thought of choosing a freer place?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "来建立围绕你自己的音乐空间。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'To build a musical space centred around yourself.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "真没想到，有点突兀。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I truly did not expect that—it comes out of the blue.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你不怕我的那些富豪大佬？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you not afraid of those wealthy tycoons rumoured around me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "就你门口站的那两位，富豪大佬很难进来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With those two guards standing outside your door, no tycoon is getting near you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我这个人名声不好，不是自找麻烦吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My reputation is terrible right now—are you not asking for trouble?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那都是低智商的谣言。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Those are all low-grade rumours.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你一点都不信啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You do not believe a single word of them?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "能有几个像你一样，在私人名下有慈善基金呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How many people like you quietly hold a charity foundation under their own name?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "听天后唱现场，刚刚那两句价值不菲。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "只是自己喜欢唱歌，纯喜欢，不卖钱。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "其实个性和商业之间的界限很难区分。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "与其签在一个把你当成商品一样的公司。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你有没有想过选择一个更自由的地方？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "来建立围绕你自己的音乐空间。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "真没想到，有点突兀。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你不怕我的那些富豪大佬？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "就你门口站的那两位，富豪大佬很难进来。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我这个人名声不好，不是自找麻烦吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那都是低智商的谣言。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你一点都不信啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "能有几个像你一样，在私人名下有慈善基金呢？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Instead of exploiting the scandal, Chun Yuqiao offers Xin Huimei genuine artistic respect when every other company backed away. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "下次见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
